@kenitlapor2024 Research shown that Malaysian Indians having the highest prevalence of Type 2 Diabetes (25 to 28%), followed by Malays (17 to 19%) &amp; Chinese (9 to 14%)

Shockingly, genetic only contributed 2% of risk factor. Most risk factor is lifestyle &amp; diet.

